Z||000003||00lE||08-05-2001||01:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>According to the factory manual the ecm needs 24000 ppm signal, but fiero vss supplies 4000 ppm.[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Are you sure that its 24000?  I thought that it was 2000, but I may be wrong.  You could just retain the Fiero ECM to control the speedo and the cruise control system.  With the manual trans, a VSS signal to the 7727 really isn't needed for anything other than the coolant fan turn off speed anyway.<BR>||||reg||1
